  "releaseNotes": "- Couple of enhancmements in OROptimizer.Log4Net.Log4NetHelperContext to configure the logger with configuration that has replaceable values.\n\t\t\t\tExample is <file value=\"AuthorizationServer.log\" />\n\t\t\t- Deprecated the 'Log4NetHelperContext(string logConfigurationFileName)' constructor and replaced it with four 'CreateFrom...' methods that alow loafing the configuration from file, xml string value, as well as allow passing additional parameters to enable placeholder value replacements. \n\t\t\t- Referencing 3.3.1 of 'log4net'.",
